[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走在地下牢房前的过道时，<br>碰见了在此游荡的可可。|#0104Adv11_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，可可……|#0104Adv11_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL6

[PrintTextModified Text:你有事？我睡得不好，<br>现在心情爆差的。|#0104Adv11_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在没那个心思跟你愉快地聊天。|#0104Adv11_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（亚里沙才刚死，<br>　我也不可能开开心心地跟人聊天啊……）|#0104Adv11_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:心情真的糟透了……<br>本来还想着睡个回笼觉，但没过多久审判就要开始。|#0104Adv11_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我想问，<br>关于亚里沙被杀案，<br>可可你有没有发现什么特别的事情……？|#0104Adv11_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……没有吧……这事情要我说啊，<br>还真松了一口气。|#0104Adv11_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一看就知道，她魔女化程度加深得很快，<br>我还以为自己会被她杀死……等下。|#0104Adv11_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1,ArmR1,ArmL1

; ＠備考◆焦って

[PrintTextModified Text:事先声明，我可不会因为这样就把她给杀了！|#0104Adv11_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯。|#0104Adv11_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL6

[PrintTextModified Text:啊～好困～好乏～<br>我真的每晚都睡不着……<br>小梅给我的药完全没有效好不好。|#0104Adv11_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可可带着一脸疲倦走开了。|#0104Adv11_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:本来打算在地下牢房看能不能找到些什么线索，<br>但艾玛一通寻找，也没发现什么有用的信息。|#0104Adv11_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

